Dropbox Support Implementation Plan
Goal Description
Integrate Dropbox as a supported cloud storage provider in FastMediaSorter. This involves enabling user authentication via Dropbox OAuth, listing and selecting Dropbox folders, and performing file operations (upload, download, move, copy, delete) using the Dropbox API.

User Review Required
IMPORTANT

Dropbox App Key: The Dropbox SDK requires an App Key. This key is currently missing from the codebase. I will add a placeholder DROPBOX_APP_KEY in 
gradle.properties
 (or 
build.gradle.kts
) and 
AndroidManifest.xml
. The user must provide a valid Dropbox App Key for the integration to work.

